197
00:09:40,313 --> 00:09:42,248
It's like magic!

198
00:09:43,249 --> 00:09:45,852
Next, add delicious seasonings and mix everything together

199
00:09:45,852 --> 00:09:48,321
Then stuff the filling into these long casings

200
00:09:48,321 --> 00:09:50,123
The sausages are almost ready!

201
00:09:50,123 --> 00:09:52,192
Oh, the sausages are all linked together

202
00:09:52,192 --> 00:09:53,993
That looks like so much fun!

203
00:09:53,993 --> 00:09:56,329
It looks like we could use them as a jump rope!

204
00:09:56,329 --> 00:09:57,464
Hey, don't play with them!

205
00:09:57,997 --> 00:09:58,798
Look!

206
00:09:58,798 --> 00:10:00,200
The glutinous rice has already been steamed

207
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,935
Now we'll make the rice sausage

208
00:10:01,935 --> 00:10:03,870
Are rice sausages and regular sausages

209
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:05,738
different only because of their fillings?

210
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,274
Of course not!

211
00:10:08,274 --> 00:10:10,543
Regular sausages are wrapped in small-intestine casings

212
00:10:10,543 --> 00:10:12,879
while rice sausages are wrapped in large-intestine casings

213
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:15,949
Oh, large intestine and small intestine!

214
00:10:15,949 --> 00:10:18,218
No wonder it's called Big Sausage Wraps Little Sausage!

215
00:10:18,218 --> 00:10:19,419
Hahahaha!

216
00:10:20,019 --> 00:10:20,954
