233
00:10:47,914 --> 00:10:50,450
And the delicious Big Sausage Wraps Little Sausage is ready!

234
00:10:51,050 --> 00:10:52,652
Let's eat!

235
00:10:54,988 --> 00:10:57,724
I love Big Sausage Wraps Little Sausage!

236
00:10:58,458 --> 00:10:59,259
Beelu,

237
00:10:59,259 --> 00:11:01,794
